  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes\n\nClasses from other assemblies, including HttpMessageHandler (#145, closes #118). Overrides copied the member's declared accessibility, so a protected internal member from another assembly was overridden as protected internal (CS0507), and internal or private protected virtual members were overridden although the project cannot see them. Overrides now use protected in that case, and members and constructors the project cannot access are skipped. HttpMessageHandler can now be impersonated. A class whose constructors are all inaccessible reports IMP004.\n\nNon-sealed overrides are impersonated (#143, closes #121). A method a class overrides without sealed had no setup or verification API, and calls always ran the real override. Behaviour change: such methods now behave like the class's other virtual methods. ToString, Equals and GetHashCode overrides keep their real behaviour.\n\nConstructor parameter defaults (#150, closes #149). Defaults of nullable value types (decimal? d = 1.5m, E? e = E.B), NaN and infinities were copied into the imposter's constructors as code that did not compile.\n\nName collisions in generated code:\n\nindexer parameters named like generated locals, such as arguments (#137, closes #105);\n\nmethod parameters and type parameters named like generated members, such as methodDisplayName or Called (#144, closes #107);\n\ntypes in the target's namespace named like types the imposter uses, such as Environment, Count or Exception (#136, closes #108).\n\nIndexers with in parameters (#134, closes #106). The generated imposter failed with CS1615.\n\nInternal\n\nVerification builds keep the generated files in tests/Imposter.Tests/GeneratedFiles/\\<Roslyn version>/ up to date, so generator changes show up as diffs in pull requests (#139, closes #116).\n\nThe benchmarks project compiles again and is built in CI (#141, #147).\n\nParameters and their types are described by value models, the first step towards incremental caching (#151, part of #115). Generated code is unchanged.",
